# Backend Environment Variables

## Main API (cmd/api)

```bash
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/rexiocity
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=change_me_please
JWT_EXPIRY=15m
REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=change_me_please
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY=720h

# OAuth
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Email (Brevo)
BREVO_API_KEY=
BREVO_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@rexio.pro.bd

# Media (Cloudflare R2)
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=rexio-city-media

# Server
PORT=10800
FRONTEND_URL=https://city.rexio.pro
ADMIN_URL=https://admin.rexio.pro
```

## Admin API (cmd/admin)

```bash
# Database (separate admin project)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/rexiocity_admin
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=change_me_please_admin
JWT_EXPIRY=15m
REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=change_me_please_admin
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY=720h

# Main API URL (for cross-service calls)
MAIN_API_URL=http://localhost:10800

# Server
PORT=10900
```
